---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Careers";
const description = "Tell your career story visually and effectively with Crayonweb.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/careers/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>Tell your career story visually and effectively with Crayonweb, a digital agency specializing in creative storytelling solutions.</h1>
    <p>Join Crayonweb and be part of a creative digital agency where innovation meets impact. We craft visually compelling digital experiences and career stories, and we are looking for talented individuals to help us shape the future of web design, TYPO3 development, and digital storytelling. Grow your career with opportunities to learn, create, and make a difference.</p>
    <h2>Join Our Growing Family of Innovators</h2>
    <p>At CrayonWeb, we are more than just a digital agency, we are a vibrant, innovative, and inclusive community where creativity meets technology. Our team consists of creative artists, web developers, web designers, ERP specialists, TYPO3 experts, and mobile app developers, all working together to craft visually compelling and high-performing digital solutions for businesses around the world. Joining CrayonWeb means becoming part of a family that values your ideas, nurtures your growth, and celebrates every achievement. We believe that a strong, collaborative culture is the heart of great work. Our environment encourages transparency, teamwork, and continuous learning. Every voice matters, and every contribution counts. From creative brainstorming sessions and design workshops to technical skill-building and mentorship programs, we ensure that every team member has the opportunity to grow professionally and personally. Innovation drives everything we do. At CrayonWeb, you will work on exciting projects spanning web design, TYPO3 development, mobile applications, ERP solutions, and digital marketing campaigns. You will have the freedom to experiment with the latest tools and technologies, develop your skills on challenging projects, and push the boundaries of digital experiences. Our culture rewards curiosity, initiative, and ownership, empowering team members to deliver meaningful results that make a real impact. We also understand the importance of balance. Flexibility, recognition, and a supportive environment ensure that creativity thrives. Whether collaborating remotely or in-office, our inclusive workspace enables everyone to do their best work while feeling valued and inspired. At Crayonweb, we are committed to building a family of innovators who are passionate about making a difference. If you are ready to grow, learn, and contribute to projects that inspire and engage audiences, join our team of creative artists, web developers, designers, ERP and TYPO3 specialists, and mobile app experts. Together, we create digital experiences that delight users, transform businesses, and set new standards in the digital world. Let us innovate, grow, and succeed - together.</p>
    <h2>Join Crayonweb - Current Job Openings and Career Opportunities</h2>
    <p>Looking for your next career move? Crayonweb is seeking talented professionals in web design, development, and digital solutions. Apply now and be part of our growing team!</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:2rem;margin-top:2rem">
      <article><p>Technology</p><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/ui-ux-designer/">UI/UX Designer</a></h2><p>CrayonWeb is seeking a creative UI/UX Designer to craft intuitive, visually engaging digital experiences. Collaborate with developers and creatives to design websites, apps, and digital products that delight users and drive results. (Full-Time)</p></article>
      <article><p>Business</p><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/business-development-executive/">Business Development Executive</a></h2><p>Crayonweb is looking for a proactive Business Development Executive to drive growth, build client relationships, and identify new business opportunities. Join our team and help expand our digital solutions to new markets. (Full-Time)</p></article>
      <article><p>Digital Marketing</p><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/seo-executive/">SEO Executive</a></h2><p>Crayonweb is seeking an SEO Executive to optimize websites, improve search rankings, and drive organic traffic. Join our team to implement strategies that enhance online visibility and boost business growth. (Full-Time)</p></article>
      <article><p>Technology</p><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/front-end-developer/">Front-End Developer</a></h2><p>Crayonweb is seeking a talented Front-End Developer to build responsive, visually engaging websites and web applications. Collaborate with designers and developers to create seamless user experiences across all devices. (Full-Time)</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
